<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi SAMA sees no interest rate change now.</title>
<headline>Saudi SAMA sees no interest rate change now.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabian Monetary Agency (SAMA) governor Hamad Saud al-Sayyari said he expected no change in Saudi interest rates at the moment.</p>
<p>&quot;For the present time they are where they are...There is no decision to change them,&quot; he told reporters on the sidelines of a Gulf Cooperation Council (GCC) banking conference in Manama.</p>
<p>The GCC is made up of Saudi Arabia, Bahrain, Kuwait, Oman, Qatar and the United Arab Emirates.</p>
</text>
